Third-party data
----------------
The astronomical culture data under `scripts/data/` (Stellarium Chinese sky
culture: asterism definitions, line topology, Chinese star names) and the
derived file `src/data/chineseSky.json` originate from the Stellarium project
(https://github.com/Stellarium/stellarium). They are distributed under the
upstream Stellarium license terms and are NOT covered by the MIT license above.
Please consult the Stellarium repository for the exact terms before
redistributing those files.
